# Durable-arm event logs from a SWE-bench sweep: one fsynced log per instance,
# written while the sweep runs. The predictions file and its .runlog.jsonl are
# the artifacts worth committing; these are the raw post-mortem record, and
# committing them mid-sweep captures a half-written log.
swebench/*.durable-events/

# install.sh output. The bundle holds REAL secret values (it is how a second
# host gets stood up at all — teploy's age store lives on the server and there
# is no other way to read them back); the overlay is one operator's box.
ship-secrets.env
*.secrets.env
teploy.install.yml
